judge_summary.user:
SOURCE ("{title}"):
{text}

SUMMARY:
{summary}

Score the summary from 1 (poor) to 5 (exact) on consistency (it never contradicts the source), completeness (the main points of this part are present) and factual_alignment (every figure and claim can be found in the source). List each concrete fault in faults; an empty list means none.

